  "body": "What changed: Hide Fit margin and Fit to Models for From model stock. Clear stale setup feedback when the draft shape changes. Keep Delete routed to deletion.\n\nCause: The page offered fitting for every stock shape. Its action routing depended on button positions. Shape changes kept feedback from the old draft.\n\nTests: stock_fit_controls_follow_the_selected_shape and stock_shape_change_clears_the_fit_refusal pass after merging upstream/main. The earlier run recorded both pins red before the fix. Restoring the old page and removing each guard made the pins fail again. The quick gate and UI clippy with warnings denied pass.\n\nGoldens moved: None.\n\nNot exercised: Native interactive UI.\n\nOverlaps: No overlapping changes in the clean upstream merge.\n\nChangelog: Hide unsupported stock fit controls for From model stock and clear stale fit refusals when its shape changes.\n\nFixes #1683\n",
